      55.17,
      416.7,
      295.22,
      459.06
    ],
    "text": "I, John Anthony Emmanuel Amarathunga, Minister of Lands herebydeclare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land AcquisitionAct, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose andwill be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      472.38,
      295.21,
      550.75
    ],
    "text": "The Allotment of land called \u2018Kongahamula watta\u2019\u2019 in total extentof about 0.0334 Hectare, shown and described in the Advance TracingNo. KU/MLL/2015/283 dated on 20.08.2015 prepared by theSurveyor-General, situated at the Village of TheliyagonnaMallawapitiya, Grama Niladhari Division in No. 711 in the DivisionalSecretary\u2019s Division of Mallawapitiya, Kurunegala District, NorthWestern Province and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
