      373.14,
      547.22,
      426.31
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Kongahamula Watta \u2013 Extent: About 0.0334Hectare North: Kongahamula Watta claimed by N. H. Haladeen; East: Ela;South: Hijra Mawatha; West: Kongahamula Watta claimed by NoorSadhika and Kongahamula Watta claimed by Ummu Saleema.",
